  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Heritage Signature (RFI v1.0).</strong></p><p><em>&ldquo;A wall, a riverbed, a vault floor. You read the layers the way a Mind-reader reads a mood.&rdquo;</em></p><p><strong>Read the Strata.</strong> Reaction, 1/Soma Break: when a scene changes location, or when you first touch a significant structure in-scene, gain <strong>reroll-lowest</strong> on one Mind check tied to the location until the scene ends. You may also ask the GM one &ldquo;what was the last big thing that happened here&rdquo; &mdash; they answer in one sentence, truthfully.</p>",
